        "Name" : "The Skyward Sword's Gift Offer",
        "Details" : "    Among your messages in your inbox, you find a recorded message from your representative with The Order of the Skyward Sword, the grand dragon zarakite who goes by the name of William Grandfeather, although the message comes from a mailbox with the name \"William Anderson\".  Zarakites typically have multiple names they will sometimes use, and you're guessing that this is one of Mr. Grandfeather's other names.  Playing the message, you watch his face speak, with authority and honor, yet also warm and friendly, someone who is of course a VIP as any zarakite dragon is, yet easy for any common citizen to approach and talk to with at least common, casual conversation:\r\n\r\n    \"Commander!  I hope this message finds you in good shape, and what it offers comes at a decent time.  The Order of the Skyward Sword has certainly not forgotten your mercenary company or how you have served our interests well in the past, and is willing to offer you a special favor.  I'll get to the point: I have a gift package for your mercenary company as a token of our appreciation for maintaining a good realtionship with us and respecting some of the things we stand for.  I had the pleasure of being tasked with carefully hand-picking your company's name from a list of mercenary groups that we felt we can trust to give a gift to, and your company's name made the list.\"\r\n\r\n    \"I have sent the package to be delivered to you immediately, and trust you will find it's contents of use.  It may contain some things that you won't find for sale in stores, special items that are reserved for private, special individuals and organizations.  Please understand that we don't offer this sort of thing to many.\"\r\n\r\n    \"Thank you for your time, commander.\"",
